msgstr "git-repo(1)"

#. type: Title -
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-repo.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "NAME"
msgstr "NAME"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-repo.adoc:7
msgid "git-repo - Retrieve information about the repository"
msgstr "git-repo - リポジトリーに関する情報を取得"

#. type: Title -
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-repo.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "SYNOPSIS"
msgstr "SYNOPSIS"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-repo.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\tgit repo info [--format=(keyvalue|nul)] [-z] [<key>...]\n"
"\tgit repo structure [--format=(table|keyvalue|nul)]\n"
msgstr ""
"\tgit repo info [--format=(keyvalue|nul)] [-z] [<key>...]\n"
"\tgit repo structure [--format=(table|keyvalue|nul)]\n"

#. type: Title -
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-repo.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "DESCRIPTION"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-repo.adoc:17
msgid "Retrieve information about the repository."
msgstr "リポジトリーに関する情報を取得します。"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-repo.adoc:19
msgid "THIS COMMAND IS EXPERIMENTAL. THE BEHAVIOR MAY CHANGE."
msgstr ""
"※このコマンドは実験的(EXPERIMENTAL)なものです。 振る舞いは変更される可能性が"
"あります。"

#. type: Title -
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-repo.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "COMMANDS"
msgstr "COMMANDS"

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-repo.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "`info [--format=(keyvalue|nul)] [-z] [<key>...]`"
msgstr "`info [--format=(keyvalue|nul)] [-z] [<key>...]`"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-repo.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Retrieve metadata-related information about the current repository. Only the "
"requested data will be returned based on their keys (see \"INFO KEYS\" "
"section below)."
msgstr ""
"現在のリポジトリに関するメタデータ関連の情報を取得します。要求されたデータの"
"みが、そのキーに基づいて返されます(後述の \"INFO KEYS\" セクションを参照)。"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-repo.adoc:29
msgid ""
"The values are returned in the same order in which their respective keys "
"were requested."
msgstr "値は、それぞれのキーが要求されたのと同じ順序で返されます。"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-repo.adoc:32
msgid ""
"The output format can be chosen through the flag `--format`. Two formats are "
"supported:"
msgstr ""
"出力形式は `--format` フラグで選択できます。2 つの形式をサポートします:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-repo.adoc:33
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-repo.adoc:63
#, no-wrap
msgid "`keyvalue`"
msgstr "`keyvalue`"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-repo.adoc:38
msgid ""
"output key-value pairs one per line using the `=` character as the delimiter "
"between the key and the value. Values containing \"unusual\" characters are "
"quoted as explained for the configuration variable `core.quotePath` (see "
"linkgit:git-config[1]). This is the default."
msgstr ""
"キーと値の区切り文字として `=` を使用し、キーと値のペアを 1 行に 1 つずつ出力"
"します。「通常ではない」文字を含む値は、設定変数 `core.quotePath` の説明に"
"従ってクオートされます(linkgit:git-config[1] 参照)。これがデフォルトです。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-repo.adoc:39
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-repo.adoc:69
#, no-wrap
msgid "`nul`"
msgstr "`nul`"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-repo.adoc:44
msgid ""
"similar to `keyvalue`, but using a newline character as the delimiter "
"between the key and the value and using a NUL character after each value.  "
"This format is better suited for being parsed by another applications than "
"`keyvalue`. Unlike in the `keyvalue` format, the values are never quoted."
msgstr ""
"`keyvalue` に似ていますが、キーと値の区切り文字に改行文字を使用し、各値の後"
"に NUL 文字を使用します。この形式は `keyvalue` よりも他のアプリケーションで解"
"析するのに適しています。`keyvalue` 形式とは異なり、値は決してクオートされませ"
"ん。"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-repo.adoc:46
msgid "`-z` is an alias for `--format=nul`."
msgstr "`-z` は `--format=nul` の別名です。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-repo.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "`structure [--format=(table|keyvalue|nul)]`"
msgstr "`structure [--format=(table|keyvalue|nul)]`"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-repo.adoc:50
msgid ""
"Retrieve statistics about the current repository structure. The following "
"kinds of information are reported:"
msgstr ""
"現在のリポジトリ構造に関する統計情報を取得します。以下の種類の情報が報告され"
"ます:"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-repo.adoc:52
msgid "Reference counts categorized by type"
msgstr "種類別の参照数"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-repo.adoc:53
msgid "Reachable object counts categorized by type"
msgstr "種類別の到達可能オブジェクト数"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-repo.adoc:57
msgid ""
"The output format can be chosen through the flag `--format`. Three formats "
"are supported:"
msgstr ""
"出力形式は `--format` フラグで選択できます。3 つの形式をサポートします:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-repo.adoc:58
#, no-wrap
msgid "`table`"
msgstr "`table`"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-repo.adoc:62
msgid ""
"Outputs repository stats in a human-friendly table. This format may change "
"and is not intended for machine parsing. This is the default format."
msgstr ""
"リポジトリの統計情報を、人間に読みやすい表形式で出力します。この形式は変更さ"
"れる可能性があり、機械による解析を意図していません。これがデフォルト形式で"
"す。"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-repo.adoc:68
msgid ""
"Each line of output contains a key-value pair for a repository stat.  The "
"'=' character is used to delimit between the key and the value.  Values "
"containing \"unusual\" characters are quoted as explained for the "
"configuration variable `core.quotePath` (see linkgit:git-config[1])."
msgstr ""
"出力の各行には、リポジトリ統計のキーと値のペアが含まれます。キーと値の区切り"
"には '=' 文字を使用します。「通常ではない」文字を含む値は、設定変数 `core."
"quotePath` の説明に従ってクオートされます(linkgit:git-config[1] 参照)。"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-repo.adoc:75
msgid ""
"Similar to `keyvalue`, but uses a NUL character to delimit between key-value "
"pairs instead of a newline. Also uses a newline character as the delimiter "
"between the key and value instead of '='. Unlike the `keyvalue` format, "
"values containing \"unusual\" characters are never quoted."
msgstr ""
"`keyvalue` に似ていますが、キーと値のペアの区切りに改行ではなく NUL 文字を使"
"用します。また、キーと値の区切りには '=' の代わりに改行文字を使用します。"
"`keyvalue` 形式とは異なり、「通常ではない」文字を含む値も決してクオートされま"
"せん。"

#. type: Title -
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-repo.adoc:77
#, no-wrap
msgid "INFO KEYS"
msgstr "INFO KEYS"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-repo.adoc:81
msgid ""
"In order to obtain a set of values from `git repo info`, you should provide "
"the keys that identify them. Here's a list of the available keys and the "
"values that they return:"
msgstr ""
"`git repo info` から値の集合を得るには、それらを識別するキーを指定する必要が"
"あります。利用可能なキーと、それらが返す値の一覧は次のとおりです:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-repo.adoc:82
#, no-wrap
msgid "`layout.bare`"
msgstr "`layout.bare`"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-repo.adoc:84
msgid "`true` if this is a bare repository, otherwise `false`."
msgstr "ベアリポジトリであれば `true`、そうでなければ `false` です。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-repo.adoc:85
#, no-wrap
msgid "`layout.shallow`"
msgstr "`layout.shallow`"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-repo.adoc:87
msgid "`true` if this is a shallow repository, otherwise `false`."
msgstr "shallow リポジトリであれば `true`、そうでなければ `false` です。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-repo.adoc:88
#, no-wrap
msgid "`object.format`"
msgstr "`object.format`"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-repo.adoc:90
msgid "The object format (hash algorithm) used in the repository."
msgstr "リポジトリで使用されているオブジェクト形式(ハッシュアルゴリズム)です。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-repo.adoc:91
#, no-wrap
msgid "`references.format`"
msgstr "`references.format`"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-repo.adoc:93
msgid "The reference storage format. The valid values are:"
msgstr "参照ストレージ形式です。有効な値は次のとおりです:"

#. type: Title -
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-repo.adoc:97
#, no-wrap
msgid "EXAMPLES"
msgstr "EXAMPLES"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-repo.adoc:100
msgid "Retrieves the reference format of the current repository:"
msgstr "現在のリポジトリの参照形式を取得します:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-repo.adoc:103
#, no-wrap
msgid "git repo info references.format\n"
msgstr "git repo info references.format\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-repo.adoc:108
msgid ""
"Retrieves whether the current repository is bare and whether it is shallow "
"using the `nul` format:"
msgstr ""
"`nul` 形式を使って、現在のリポジトリがベアかどうか、および shallow かどうかを"
"取得します:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-repo.adoc:111
#, no-wrap
msgid "git repo info --format=nul layout.bare layout.shallow\n"
msgstr "git repo info --format=nul layout.bare layout.shallow\n"

